    {"publicCode":"direct_recharge_product_unavailable","httpStatus":409,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/direct-recharge-product-unavailable","retryGuidance":"Choose an available transfer priced for this wallet tier.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"package_unavailable","httpStatus":409,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/package-unavailable","retryGuidance":"Choose an available package and use a new Idempotency-Key.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"meter_rejected","httpStatus":422,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/meter-rejected","retryGuidance":"Correct the meter number and use a new Idempotency-Key for a new attempt.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"invalid_credentials","httpStatus":401,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/invalid-credentials","retryGuidance":"Correct the signing credentials or profile before retrying; key and application state details are intentionally indistinguishable.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"signature_expired","httpStatus":401,"retryable":true,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/signature-expired","retryGuidance":"Reserved: the current API never sends this code. A signature outside its validity window is answered invalid_credentials (401); sign again with current timestamps.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"invalid_content_digest","httpStatus":400,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/invalid-content-digest","retryGuidance":"Reserved: the current API never sends this code. A Content-Digest that does not match the body is answered malformed_signed_request (400).","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"malformed_signed_request","httpStatus":400,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/malformed-signed-request","retryGuidance":"Rebuild how the request is signed: send both Signature and Signature-Input, cover the required components in the documented order, send every header the route requires, and compute Content-Digest over the exact body bytes. Repeating the same request unchanged fails the same way.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"replay_detected","httpStatus":409,"retryable":true,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/replay-detected","retryGuidance":"Use a fresh nonce and signature while preserving the idempotency key for the same business intent.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"source_ip_not_allowed","httpStatus":403,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/source-ip-not-allowed","retryGuidance":"Anis network protection blocked this source address. Contact Anis support with the address if it should be allowed.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"insufficient_scope","httpStatus":403,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/insufficient-scope","retryGuidance":"The application is not permitted to make this call: check that it holds the permission the call needs and that you call from a network agreed with Anis, then ask Anis staff to change either.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"binding_not_authorized","httpStatus":403,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/binding-not-authorized","retryGuidance":"Restore the directly owned active account and Business subscription before making a new request.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"resource_not_found","httpStatus":404,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/resource-not-found","retryGuidance":"Verify the resource identifier and application ownership; inaccessible resources are intentionally indistinguishable from absence.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"card_not_found","httpStatus":404,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/card-not-found","retryGuidance":"Verify the sold-card identifier and wallet; absent and inaccessible single cards return the same representation.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"wallet_not_granted","httpStatus":404,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/wallet-not-granted","retryGuidance":"Obtain an approved current wallet grant before making a new request.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"validation_failed","httpStatus":422,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/validation-failed","retryGuidance":"Check the request model and framing. Money-operation creates and recipient updates accept at most 8192 UTF-8 body bytes. Recipient validation of a direct recharge may return safe messages in extensions.fields; other validation does not identify fields. Preserve the same key for unchanged accepted intent; a corrected business intent needs a new key.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"idempotency_conflict","httpStatus":409,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/idempotency-conflict","retryGuidance":"Reuse the key only for identical intent. This code does not say the original request failed: it may already have been accepted and charged, so never assume nothing was charged; read the original operation by its id (the meter charge or the direct recharge) before any new attempt. A repeated create whose id is still unknown to this application a minute after it was admitted also closes as idempotency_conflict (409); use a new UUID only for a genuinely new operation.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"operation_processing","httpStatus":202,"retryable":true,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/operation-processing","retryGuidance":"Not an error: the operation is still processing. Respect Retry-After; read its Location or repeat the identical create with the same Idempotency-Key.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"allowed_debt_consent_required","httpStatus":402,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/allowed-debt-consent-required","retryGuidance":"Submit a new operation with explicit allowed-debt consent if the Partner intends to use debt.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"insufficient_balance","httpStatus":409,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/insufficient-balance","retryGuidance":"Submit a new operation only after the authoritative balance or allowed-debt state changes.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"purchase_not_allowed","httpStatus":403,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/purchase-not-allowed","retryGuidance":"The owner policy forbids this purchase; obtain authorization before submitting a new operation.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"purchase_not_allowed","httpStatus":409,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/order-refused","retryGuidance":"The request conflicts with current owner business state; submit a new operation only after that state changes.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"owner_limit_exceeded","httpStatus":409,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/owner-limit-exceeded","retryGuidance":"Do not poll; submit a new operation and idempotency key only after the owner allowance is known to have changed.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"daily_limit_exceeded","httpStatus":429,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/daily-limit-exceeded","retryGuidance":"No reset time is available; submit a new operation and idempotency key only after the limit condition is known to have cleared.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"rate_limited","httpStatus":429,"retryable":true,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/rate-limited","retryGuidance":"honour Retry-After when present; otherwise use bounded exponential backoff.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"spending_limit_exceeded","httpStatus":429,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/spending-limit-exceeded","retryGuidance":"The operation was not accepted: it would take the application's spending above its ceiling for the current period. Do not repeat it; after the Retry-After delay (the end of the period) submit a new operation and idempotency key, or ask Anis staff to change the ceiling.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"wallet_disabled","httpStatus":409,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/wallet-disabled","retryGuidance":"Submit a new request only after the wallet has been re-enabled.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"wallet_expired","httpStatus":409,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/wallet-expired","retryGuidance":"Submit a new request only after the account or Business subscription expiry is resolved.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"business_subscription_required","httpStatus":409,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/business-subscription-required","retryGuidance":"Restore an active Business subscription before making a new request.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"account_inactive","httpStatus":403,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/account-inactive","retryGuidance":"Confirm or re-enable the owner account before making a new request.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"currency_not_supported","httpStatus":422,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/currency-not-supported","retryGuidance":"Use the currency required by the authoritative wallet and Catalogue contract.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"card_unavailable","httpStatus":409,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/card-unavailable","retryGuidance":"Refresh Catalogue data and submit a new operation if the item becomes available.","publicDocumentation":true},
    {"publicCode":"quantity_unavailable","httpStatus":409,"retryable":false,"type":"https://developers.anis.ly/errors/quantity-unavailable","retryGuidance":"Refresh Catalogue data or submit a new operation with an available quantity.","publicDocumentation":true},
